ioModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Host IO via WASI (fd_write/fd_read/path_open).
    Provides: sir_print_i64(v) -> out Prints an integer.
    Provides: sir_read_str() -> out Reads stdin into a string.
    Provides: sir_print_val(v) -> out Prints any boxed value.
    Provides: sir_read_file(pathBox) -> out Reads a whole file.
    Provides: sir_log(msg) -> out Diagnostic log line (single iov, iovs_len=1).
